FACTS = {
    'runaway-single-mom-and-her-billionaire-hubby': "In Runaway Single Mom and Her Billionaire Hubby, Grace Bennett escaped an abusive relationship and had to fend for herself and her daughter. They gambled on a fresh start, hoping to build a better life without Grace's ex and their twisted past. Everything changed when Ethan Callahan walked into their lives. Living with a disability and traumatized by his family's greed, Ethan proposed a casual marriage to Grace. He promised to help her raise Lily. He offered his wealth, his protection, and his love in exchange for companionship. Wanting only the best for her daughter, Grace took the risk and let him into her guarded heart. As their arrangement brought them closer, figures from their past resurfaced, secrets began to unravel, and more enemies threatened to tear them apart. Could Grace, Lily, and Ethan survive against all odds? Characters Grace Bennett Grace Bennett is the female lead in Runaway Single Mom and Her Billionaire Hubby. She's a single mother who moved to California for Derek, her ex, only to discover he had been lying all this time. She's hardworking, resilient, and compassionate. She deserves all the love, and Ethan is the perfect man to provide it. Ethan Callahan Ethan Callahan is the male protagonist. He's a billionaire who uses a wheelchair after an accident years ago. His mobility was affected, but his heart remained as it was—kind, considerate, and full of love. Lily Lily is Grace's little daughter. She's a bubbly, energetic child who becomes a victim of her father's lies and abuse. She becomes Grace's inspiration, and she always appreciates her mother's hard work and sacrifices. Derek Sullivan Derek Sullivan is one of the primary antagonists. He's an arrogant, lazy, and narcissistic man who kept Grace and Lily around for the sake of money. He drains Grace's money to fund his needs and help his family, completely ignoring his responsibilities as a father.",
    'lulu-the-little-goddess': "In Lulu the Little Goddess, Lulu possesses rare magic that can heal all living things. She is driven out by villagers who mistake her for an evil witch and blame her for the plague. During her escape, she encounters the wounded King Alaric of Elyria and brings him back to life. It is the beginning of her adventures as the new royal princess. After King Alaric adopts her, more miracles happen in his kingdom. Lulu heals his dying son, Cassian, and even awakens the thousand-year-old Dawlight Dragon. Together, the three of them face crises, fight hunger, and end the evil reign of the Nockent Clan. By repeatedly saving the royal family and civilians, Lulu protects the whole continent from destruction. Characters Lulu Lulu is the female protagonist of Lulu the Little Goddess. She's a little witch whose background remains shrouded in mystery as the story progresses. She's bubbly, kind-hearted, and already knows right from wrong—a true sign that she's a goddess walking among humans. King Alaric King Alaric is the male protagonist. He's the compassionate and merciful king of Elyria. His wife died weeks ago, and he's been searching for the Sacred Lotus to heal his son, Cassian. He finds Lulu instead. He later realizes she's worth more than the mystical flower. Cassian Cassian is King Alaric's bedridden son. He falls ill after his mother's mysterious death and has never known peace since. Lulu becomes his little savior and the only one who gives him enough hope to keep fighting.",
    'shattered-bonds-of-the-fae-brothers': "In Shattered Bonds of the Fae Brothers, Lyra Solis witnessed the betrayal of the Fae princes she had protected for years. They cast her aside to choose Blair, her manipulative maid, as their one true mate. Devastated and enraged, she severed their bond and accepted the Dragon King's marriage proposal. While the princes expected her to come crawling back, Lyra sought shelter in Valerius' mighty arms. She was uncertain if the notorious, fearsome Dragon King could ever be capable of love. Valerius proved her wrong when he gave her everything the princes never did—devotion, loyalty, and a crown to lead his empire. The woman they deemed unworthy eventually became the Dragon Queen—forever out of their reach and valued by a man they loathed. Only then did regret settle in. Characters Lyra Solis Lyra Solis is the female protagonist. She's the orphaned elf who saved the princes ten years ago. She's fearless, kind-hearted, and driven by a sense of justice. She's perfect to be the next elf queen, but fate has more in store for her. Valerius Valerius is the male protagonist. He's the notorious Dragon King who rules the endless sea and wages war against almost every other kind. He's ruthless and filled with darkness, but is equally respectful to anyone he sees as worthy of it. Rowan and Kaleb Aurelius Rowan and Kaleb Aurelius are the ignorant princes who betrayed Lyra. They're arrogant, condescending, and gullible, always thinking their words are the law. Fate eventually humbles them through Lyra's success and Blair's betrayal. Blair Blair is the primary female antagonist. She's a low-life maid who manipulated the princes to gain their sympathy. She spreads lies to ruin Lyra, but her success proves temporary when Lyra exposes her in the end.",
    'their-brother-the-dragon-sacrifice': "The Story of Their Brother the Dragon Sacrifice: In Their Brother the Dragon Sacrifice movie, after years of abuse, beatings, and mistreatment, eighteen-year-old Alistair, the foster son of the Quinn family, volunteered to become the human sacrifice to save the realm. Unaware of his ultimate sacrifice, his family falling for his brother Dorian's lies continued to mistreat him. Tired and broken, Alister entered the dragon valley expecting death. But when the dragons kneeled in front of him, his true identity as the lost dragon prince was revealed. Reborn and empowered, Alistair returned to claim his crown only for the Quinn family to beg for his forgiveness as Dorian's lies were finally exposed. Left with deep regrets, will the Quinn family win over Alistair's forgiveness? Or will they face their dragon king's wrath? Characters: Alistair Alistair was the eighteen-year-old male lead of Their Brother, the Dragon Sacrifice. He was the abused orphan who entered the dragon valley as a human sacrifice only to return as the dragon king. Dorian Dorian was the antagonist of Their Brother, the Dragon Sacrifice. He was the manipulative and scheming brother of Alistair, who falsely framed him again and again until his true colors were exposed. Lord Quinn Lord Quinn was the head of House Quinn. He raised Alistair like his own until he fell prey to Dorian's lies and cast him aside as trash. Lady Quinn Lady Quinn was Alistair's foster mother. She stripped Alistair of his title as her son, believing Dorian's lies only to regret it all in the end. Sule Sule was the dragon leader who recognized Alistair as the lost prince and helped him reclaim his true identity and achieve his true destiny as the Dragon King.",
    'the-double-life-of-mr-president': 'Claire, a small-town girl working at a fried chicken shop, accidentally stumbles into the hotel suite of U.S. President William. After helping him relieve an aphrodisiac’s effects with her body, she then aids the gunshot-wounded president in evading his pursuers. Grateful, William proposes a contractual marriage—but Claire mistakenly believes he’s just a presidential body double. The truth only comes crashing down when she’s kidnapped by the mafia and William storms in with a Special Forces team.',
    'the-sea-god-s-disguise-fishing-for-love': "The Story of The Sea God's Disguise Fishing for Love: In The Sea God's Disguise Fishing for Love movie, Sixty years ago Edmund Ashford saved the sea god's life. So to honor his dying wish, the sea god disguised himself as an ordinary fisherman, Magnus, and married his daughter, Adriana, to protect the Ashford family for three years. But his marriage turned toxic when Adriana refused to see his heart while Magnus secretly protected the Ashfords. Only to face cruel pranks and abuse in return. The last straw was when Adriana chose her unworthy ex, Sebastian Haverworth, over him. Tired and exhausted, Magnus walked away as their three-year marriage contract ended. With Magnus gone, Adriana finally realized the truth and came back crawling for a second chance. Will the sea god forgive his ungrateful wife? Or will he reclaim his divine throne? Characters: Magnus Magnus was the main character of The Sea God's Disguise: Fishing for Love. He was the ocean god who married Adriana Ashford, disguising himself as an ordinary fisherman to repay a debt. But after three years of insults and humiliations, he walked away to reclaim his divine throne, leaving his wife in regrets. Adriana Ashford Adriana Ashford was Magnus's ungrateful wife. For three years she failed to see through Magnus's love and devotion. Instead, she chose her ex, only to soon regret it all. Sebastian Haverworth Sebastian Haverworth is the antagonist of The Sea God's Disguise: Fishing for Love. He was the unworthy ex, a Royal Navy general who returned to win back Adriana to use her to cover his debts. Edmund Ashford Edmund Ashford was the patriarch of the Ashford family who saved the Sea God's life. In return, he had the Sea God marry his daughter to protect his family.",
    'surf-god-s-revenge': "Duke is the secret god of his island home, and he loves surfing on his magic Koa wood board more than anything. But the powerful Sea Hag curses him and shrinks his board. To get it back, he has to stay married to Kai, the Sea Hag's human daughter, for 5 years. Duke helps Kai rise to stardom as a surfer, but Kai thinks Duke is just a worthless house husband. She mistreats him, and falls back in with her ex-boyfriend, a world famous surfer. When the five years are up and the curse is lifted, Duke must choose – stay with Kai and hope she recognizes his worth or divorce her and live life on his own terms?",
    'the-dragon-king-s-forbidden-maid': 'Maid Joanna conceives a dragon heir by King Atlas on the Night of the Lunar Eclipse. Queen Sophia scars her and jails her in the Tower of Oblivion, where she raises Louis. Louis saves the Queen Mother; Atlas recognizes the woman from six years ago. Sophia and her father Augustus forge the bloodline crystal and rebel. The Queen Mother exposes them, and Atlas crushes the rebels. Atlas crowns Joanna, who carries a second child.',
    'the-outcast-returns-supreme-wolf-god': 'Raised in the wilderness by a poor but loving couple, Corven discovers he is the long-lost heir of powerful House Kelun. But the reunion he dreamed of turns into a nightmare when his birth family treats him like an outsider and favors their adopted son, Dorian. When Corven finds his sister gravely injured, Dorian frames him for the attack. Can Corven clear his name and expose the truth?',
    'feeding-the-dragon-s-desir': "TZyrthos, the king of the dragon clan, is mortally cursed. Only by drinking the milk of the human woman Vera can he live. Vera broke into the Dragon Nest to apply for a nanny in order to save her young son, but she didn't know that she was the antidode that the Dragon King was looking for - not tole that Toby, the sick son in her arms, was actually the bloodline left by the Dragon King in the foggy forest a year ago. He thirsted for her body like a bloodthirsty, and she ran away desperately, and fate had already written this immortal love into the curse of the keel and blood.",
    'her-secret-lycan-king': 'Lyra is about to be exiled for her “cursed” wolf unless she can find a legal mate overnight. Luckily, the mysterious man she rescued earlier agrees to marry her on the spot. Their fake marriage quickly becomes real and spicy, while Lyra gradually realizes that her omega husband might be the missing Alpha King, Caius…',
    'scoring-on-my-football-captain-stepbrother': 'When Alex enters his stepbrother Liam’s world of privilege and power, the only thing they share is mutual contempt. But hate is a dangerous game—and the closer they become, the more they stand to lose. Two boys, one secret, and a line neither of them can cross. Until they do.',
    'proposal-to-breakup-i-saw-the-truth': 'Rose dates Ethan for seven years, only to face breakup pranks at three supposed‑proposal events. She discovers Ethan is already married to Claire and loses her babies. She ruins her wedding dress, exposes the truth at the wedding and flees to Paris. Five years later, Rose becomes a fashion design director with a new partner. At a fashion show, Ethan begs for reconciliation while Claire provokes her. Rose fights back calmly and steps onto her own runway.',
    'replaced-the-hockey-captain-with-the-school-prince': "When Claire's boyfriend humiliates her on the school bus, she blurts out one desperate lie — Her real boyfriend is student council president Kingston Blake, sitting right next to her. Instead of exposing her, he plays along. Soon he's defending her from bullies, fixing broken cameras to keep her safe at night, and secretly funding her band when no one else believes in her dream. But when her ex comes crawling back, will Claire choose her ex or the boy who's been quietly falling for her all along?",
    'whirlwind-marriage-ex-lost-it': 'Blythe dated Orion for five years and damaged her optic nerve saving him in a mountain accident. Before their wedding, she found he spoiled Celeste and secretly changed their venue. When Orion skipped their seaside wedding for Celeste, Blythe married her caring ophthalmologist Desmond at their original mountain chapel instead. Orion broke his leg taking reckless snow risks to win her back, then was deserted by Celeste. Blythe began a new pregnant life with Desmond.',
    'past-loves-and-new-beginnings': "Pregnant heiress Nicole discovers her father married his mistress and her husband held a wedding with her half-sister. Saving her baby with Andrew's help, she seizes the family fortune, exposes them, and takes her life back.",
    'the-lunar-eclipse-s-scar': "On her mating night, Selena finds fated mate Alpha Aiden kissing Lily, the Omega she raised like a sister. Framed and abandoned by the pack, she severs her memories with a witch and vanishes into the Lunar Guard's war zone. Five years later, she returns as an undefeated general—while Aiden has spent years haunted by losing her. Selena no longer remembers the bond, and must decide whether the past deserves to be remembered or buried forever.",
    'the-billionaire-tiny-secret-wife': 'Layla, a gifted translator, enters into a flash marriage with Cassian, a corporate tycoon, to pay off her student loans. After taking up her post under the guise of a secret marriage, she is repeatedly framed by her supervisor, Cressida. Leveraging her capabilities, she rises in her career, heals little Romy, the adorable child. Amid a kidnapping crisis and mysteries surrounding her lineage, she and Cassian uncover the truth behind his past amnesia. Eventually, they reveal their secret marriage and embrace a happy reunion as a family of four.',
}
